#: 62443c7cce9544bdb3adc9e62d3a6c77
msgid "The MambaH743v4 supports up to 9 PWM outputs. The pads for motor output M1 to M8 are provided on both the motor connectors and on separate pads, plus M9 on a separate pad for LED strip or another PWM output."
